From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MihaZupan <miha@mihubot.xyz>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 08:09:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] native: retain Molly JNI utilities and fork API contracts

Port the retained Molly semantic intent directly onto stable Signal 8.34.2.
Source, API, resource and build integration are adapted to this target;
the earlier extraction's unmodified-blob claims do not apply here.

Upstream-baseline: 515db93fb48206d63406cbfb48c5816f6af1d9e2
Prior-version-input: 8f3064dffc7e7ab9ab43a50b804b88b22717f635
Semantic-boundary: 01/36

